{
  "title": "Dua Aaliyah al Mazameen Dua to be recited after the Ziyarah of every Masoomeen (a)",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْ زُرْتُ هٰذَا الْاِمَامَ مُقِرًّا بِاِمَامَتِهٖ مُعْتَقِدًا لِفَرْضِ طَاعَتِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE ZURTU HAADHAL IMAAMA MUQIRRAM BI-IMAAMATIH, MU'TAQIDAL LI-FARDI TAA'ATIH\nO Allah, I am visiting this Imam confessing his Imamate and believing in the obligation of obedience to him;\nفَقَصَدْتُ مَشْهَدَهٗ بِذُنُوْبِيْ وَ مُوْبِقَاتِ اٰثَامِيْ وَ كَثْرَةِ عُيُوْبِيْ\nFAQASADTU MASH-HADAHU BI-DHUNOOBOOBEE WA MOOBIQATI AATHAAMEE WA KATHRATI U'YOOBEE\ntherefore, I have betaken myself to his shrine in spite of all of my sins, mortal offenses, and numerous defects,\nوَ شِدَّةِ وَزَرِيْ وَ اَنَا مُسْتَجِيْرٌ بِكَ فِيْ هٰذَا الْوَقْتِ وَ بِهٖ\nWA SHIDDATI WAZAREE WA ANAA MUSTAJEERUM BIKA FEE HAADHAL WAQTI WA BIH\nand the heaviness of my burdens, and I am seeking refuge with You at this time and through him,\nفَاغْفِرْ لِيْ ذُنُوْبِيْ كُلَّهَا يَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nFAGHFIR LEE DHUNOOBOOBEE KULLAHAA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nso forgive me all my sins, O most Merciful of all those who show mercy!",
  "merits": "Sayyid Ibn Tawus, in his book of Misbah al-Za'ir, has mentioned this supplicatory prayer to be said directly after the comprehensive form of ziyarah that is known as Ziyarah of the Imams of the Believers:"
